{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"جمل أطول ومفردات أقلّ شيوعًا. الكلمات الجديدة في معظمها مشروحة أدناه."},{"btype":"example","text":"Please say it again.","note":"من فضلك، قله مرة أخرى."},{"btype":"example","text":"Please say something.","note":"قُل شيئاً, رجاءً."},{"btype":"example","text":"Please think about it.","note":"من فضلك فكر في الأمر."},{"btype":"example","text":"I wanted to please you.","note":"أردتُ إسعادك فقط."},{"btype":"example","text":"Please get out of the car.","note":"اخرج من السّيّارة من فضلك."},{"btype":"example","text":"Will you please let me go now?","note":"هل تسمح لي بالذهاب الآن؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Could you come in here, please.","note":"أيمكنك المجيء إلى هنا، رجاءًا."},{"btype":"example","text":"Please tell me what I should do.","note":"من فضلك، أخبرني بما ينبغي أن أفعله."},{"btype":"example","text":"Sami got down.","note":"نزل سامي."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ziri was down.","note":"كان زيري كئيبا."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ziri went down.","note":"نزل زيري."},{"btype":"example","text":"Don't let me down.","note":"لا تتخلى علي."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"en","lang_name":"الإنجليزية","sentences":[{"t":"Please say it again.","ar":"من فضلك، قله مرة أخرى."},{"t":"Please say something.","ar":"قُل شيئاً, رجاءً."},{"t":"Please think about it.","ar":"من فضلك فكر في الأمر."},{"t":"I wanted to please you.","ar":"أردتُ إسعادك فقط."},{"t":"Please ge